[fsw_info_fresh]
columns=1
table=fsw_info_fresh_table
columndef=0:info,string,string,string
values=0:0:A new world to conquer,A new world ready to be explored and conquered,A new world that is ready to be explored and conquered.
values=0:1:A fresh economy to stock,A Fresh economy ready to be stocked and supplied,A fresh economy that is ready to be stocked and supplied. Set your own prices and control the market.
values=0:2:Attain World Firsts,World Firsts. Will you be the one to achieve one?,World Firsts system. Will you be the first to achieve that 99\\, kill that boss\\, complete that grandmaster quest\\, or get that rare item drop?
values=0:3:Earn Achievement Points,Achievement Points. Compete against your friends to see who gets the highest score,Achievement point system. Compete against your friends to see who can rank the highest. Levels\\, quest points\\, boss kills\\, and more. It all counts towards your score!
values=0:4:Like minded players,Join other like minded players all starting at the same time to shape the world together,Join other like minded players and shape the world together. Only new accounts can join\\, so everyone starts together.
values=0:5:6 month duration,6 month duration. Once over you'll be moved over to the main game to continue your adventure,After 6 months your account will be moved over to the main game and your adventure will continue there. You can choose to move over at any time.

[fsw_info_normal]
columns=1
table=fsw_info_normal_table
columndef=0:info,string,string,string
values=0:0:The Old School experience as it has been for years,The Old School experience as it has been for years,The Old School experience as it has been for years
values=0:1:Thriving economy developed over the past decade,A thriving economy developed over the past decade,A thriving economy developed over the past decade
values=0:2:Join and meet thousands of players,Join and meet thousands and thousands of other players,Join and meet thousands and thousands of other players

