columndef=1:difficulty,int
values=1:0:3
columndef=2:clue_text,string
values=2:0:Try not to let yourself be dazzled when you search these drawers.
columndef=3:target,dbrow
values=3:0:1137
columndef=10:region,int
values=10:0:4

[cluehelper_cryptic_hard_0_40_51_38_3]
columns=15
table=cluehelper_clue_cryptic
columndef=0:id,int
values=0:0:862
columndef=1:difficulty,int
values=1:0:3
columndef=2:clue_text,string
values=2:0:The beasts to my east snap claws and tails\\, The rest to my west can slide and eat fish. The force to my north will jump and they'll wail\\, Come dig by my fire and make a wish.
columndef=3:target,dbrow
values=3:0:641
columndef=10:region,int
values=10:0:4

[cluehelper_cryptic_hard_0_48_54_17_12]
columns=15
table=cluehelper_clue_cryptic
columndef=0:id,int
values=0:0:863
columndef=1:difficulty,int
values=1:0:3
columndef=2:clue_text,string
values=2:0:Come to the evil ledge\\, Yew know yew want to. Try not to get stung.
columndef=3:target,dbrow
values=3:0:642
columndef=10:region,int
values=10:0:1

[cluehelper_cryptic_hard_0_48_53_9_29]
columns=15
table=cluehelper_clue_cryptic
columndef=0:id,int
values=0:0:864
columndef=1:difficulty,int
values=1:0:3
columndef=2:clue_text,string
values=2:0:THEY'RE EVERYWHERE!!!! But they were here first. Dig for treasure where the ground is rich with ore.
columndef=3:target,dbrow
values=3:0:643
columndef=10:region,int
values=10:0:1

[cluehelper_cryptic_hard_0_54_51_32_25]
columns=15
table=cluehelper_clue_cryptic
columndef=0:id,int
values=0:0:865
columndef=1:difficulty,int
values=1:0:3
columndef=2:clue_text,string
values=2:0:Covered in shadows\\, the centre of the circle is where you will find the answer.
columndef=3:target,dbrow
values=3:0:644
columndef=10:region,int
values=10:0:5

[cluehelper_cryptic_hard_0_49_57_38_15]
columns=15
table=cluehelper_clue_cryptic
columndef=0:id,int
values=0:0:866
columndef=1:difficulty,int
values=1:0:3
columndef=2:clue_text,string
values=2:0:I lie lonely and forgotten in mid wilderness\\, where the dead rise from their beds. Feel free to quarrel and wind me up\\, and dig while you shoot their heads.
columndef=3:target,dbrow
values=3:0:645
columndef=10:region,int
values=10:0:11

[cluehelper_cryptic_hard_0_44_149_16_50]
columns=15
table=cluehelper_clue_cryptic
columndef=0:id,int
values=0:0:867
columndef=1:difficulty,int
values=1:0:3
columndef=2:clue_text,string
values=2:0:Mine was the strangest birth under the sun. I left the crimson sack\\, yet life had not begun. Entered the world\\, and yet was seen by none.
columndef=3:target,dbrow
values=3:0:646
columndef=10:region,int
values=10:0:2

[cluehelper_cryptic_hard_0_40_60_31_39]
columns=15
table=cluehelper_clue_cryptic
columndef=0:id,int
values=0:0:868
columndef=1:difficulty,int
values=1:0:3
columndef=2:clue_text,string
values=2:0:And so on\\, and so on\\, and so on. Walking from the land of many unimportant things leads to a choice of paths.
columndef=3:target,dbrow
values=3:0:647
columndef=10:region,int
values=10:0:8

[cluehelper_cryptic_hard_0_49_52_59_29]
columns=15
table=cluehelper_clue_cryptic
columndef=0:id,int
values=0:0:869
columndef=1:difficulty,int
values=1:0:3
columndef=2:clue_text,string
values=2:0:Dig where 4 siblings and I all live with our evil overlord.
columndef=3:target,dbrow
values=3:0:648
columndef=10:region,int
values=10:0:1

[cluehelper_cryptic_hard_0_49_60_34_45]
columns=15
table=cluehelper_clue_cryptic
columndef=0:id,int
values=0:0:870
columndef=1:difficulty,int
values=1:0:3
columndef=2:clue_text,string
values=2:0:46 is my number. My body is the colour of burnt orange and crawls among those with eight. Three mouths I have\\, yet I cannot eat. My blinking blue eye hides my grave.
columndef=3:target,dbrow
values=3:0:649
columndef=10:region,int
values=10:0:11

[cluehelper_cryptic_hard_0_49_153_55_33]
columns=15
table=cluehelper_clue_cryptic
columndef=0:id,int
values=0:0:871
columndef=1:difficulty,int
values=1:0:3
columndef=2:clue_text,string
values=2:0:I am a token of the greatest love. I have no beginning or end. My eye is red\\, I can fit like a glove. Go to the place where it's money they lend\\, And dig by the gate to be my friend.
columndef=3:target,dbrow
values=3:0:650
columndef=10:region,int
values=10:0:1

[cluehelper_cryptic_hard_0_55_49_27_47]
columns=15
table=cluehelper_clue_cryptic
columndef=0:id,int
values=0:0:872
columndef=1:difficulty,int
values=1:0:3
columndef=2:clue_text,string
values=2:0:Rotting next to a ditch. Dig next to the fish.
columndef=3:target,dbrow
values=3:0:651
columndef=10:region,int
values=10:0:5

[cluehelper_cryptic_hard_0_52_49_60_16]
columns=15
table=cluehelper_clue_cryptic
columndef=0:id,int
values=0:0:873
columndef=1:difficulty,int
values=1:0:3
columndef=2:clue_text,string
values=2:0:Where the best are commemorated\\, and a celebratory cup\\, not just for beer.
columndef=3:target,dbrow
values=3:0:652
columndef=10:region,int
values=10:0:6

[cluehelper_cryptic_hard_0_48_50_13_55]
columns=15
table=cluehelper_clue_cryptic
columndef=0:id,int
values=0:0:874
columndef=1:difficulty,int
values=1:0:3
columndef=2:clue_text,string
values=2:0:Aggie I see. Lonely and southern I feel. I am neither inside nor outside the house\\, yet no home would be complete without me. The treasure lies beneath me!
columndef=3:target,dbrow
values=3:0:653
columndef=10:region,int
values=10:0:1

[cluehelper_cryptic_hard_0_49_154_25_48]
columns=15
table=cluehelper_clue_cryptic
columndef=0:id,int
values=0:0:875
columndef=1:difficulty,int
values=1:0:3
columndef=2:clue_text,string
values=2:0:My giant guardians below the market streets would be fans of rock and roll\\, if only they could grab hold of it. Dig near my green bubbles!
columndef=3:target,dbrow
values=3:0:654
columndef=10:region,int
values=10:0:1

[cluehelper_cryptic_hard_0_18_56_27_42]
columns=15
table=cluehelper_clue_cryptic
columndef=0:id,int
values=0:0:876
columndef=1:difficulty,int
values=1:0:3
columndef=2:clue_text,string
values=2:0:The effects of this fire are magnified.
columndef=3:target,dbrow
values=3:0:655
columndef=10:region,int
values=10:0:9

[cluehelper_cryptic_hard_0_28_155_28_15]
columns=15
table=cluehelper_clue_cryptic
columndef=0:id,int
values=0:0:877
columndef=1:difficulty,int
values=1:0:3
columndef=2:clue_text,string
values=2:0:Dig in the lair of red wings\\, within the temple of the Sun and Moon.
columndef=3:target,dbrow
values=3:0:656
columndef=10:region,int
values=10:0:10

[cluehelper_cryptic_hard_0_55_68_52_20]
