columndef=0:id,int
values=0:0:687
columndef=1:difficulty,int
values=1:0:4
columndef=2:clue_text,string
values=2:0:I am the one who watches the giants. The giants in turn watch me. I watch with two while they watch with one. Come seek where I may be.
