columndef=0:id,int
values=0:0:820
columndef=1:difficulty,int
values=1:0:4
columndef=2:clue_text,string
values=2:0:Even the seers say this clue goes right over their heads.
columndef=3:target,dbrow
values=3:0:1121
columndef=10:region,int
values=10:0:4

[cluehelper_cryptic_elite_0_53_51_18_60]
columns=15
table=cluehelper_clue_cryptic
columndef=0:id,int
values=0:0:850
columndef=1:difficulty,int
values=1:0:4
columndef=2:clue_text,string
values=2:0:Right on the blessed border\\, cursed by the evil ones. On the spot inaccessible by both; I will be waiting. The bugs' imminent possession holds the answer.
