columndef=0:id,int
values=0:0:856
columndef=1:difficulty,int
values=1:0:4
columndef=2:clue_text,string
values=2:0:Three rule below and three sit at top. Come dig at my entrance.
columndef=3:target,dbrow
values=3:0:635
columndef=10:region,int
values=10:0:8

[cluehelper_cryptic_elite_0_51_148_43_33]
columns=15
table=cluehelper_clue_cryptic
columndef=0:id,int
values=0:0:857
columndef=1:difficulty,int
values=1:0:4
columndef=2:clue_text,string
values=2:0:Desert insects is what I see. Taking care of them was my responsibility. Your solution is found by digging near me.
columndef=3:target,dbrow
values=3:0:636
columndef=10:region,int
values=10:0:6

[cluehelper_cryptic_elite_0_36_57_38_29]
columns=15
table=cluehelper_clue_cryptic
columndef=0:id,int
values=0:0:858
columndef=1:difficulty,int
values=1:0:4
columndef=2:clue_text,string
values=2:0:The beasts retreat\\, for their Queen is gone; the song of this town still plays on. Dig near the birthplace of a blade\\, be careful not to melt your spade.
