[reward_power_miner]
columns=16
table=reward
columndef=0:name,string
values=0:0:Power Miner
columndef=1:desc,string
values=1:0:- This pickaxe will act as a non-degradable variant of the crystal equivalent with no requirements.<br><br>- When this item is in your inventory or equipped\\, you gain the following perks:<br><br>- On failing to mine a rock\\, you will have a separate 50% chance to succeed.<br><br>- Items gathered from Mining are automatically sent to your Bank.<br><br>- The Echo Pickaxe will cause the rock to not deplete until you have mined 4 ore.<br><br>- This buff does stack with the existing Mining Gloves\\, with a cap of 7 ores from a given node.<br><br>You will be able to toggle the following effects on or off for the Pickaxe:<br><br>- Collected ores are automatically smelted and grant Smithing XP (regardless of your smithing level).<br><br>- Gems gathered from Mining are automatically cut and grant Crafting XP regardless of your Crafting level.
columndef=3:display_graphic,graphic
values=3:0:6665
columndef=12:league_relic,struct
values=12:0:1117
columndef=15:once_per_event,boolean
values=15:0:1

[reward_lumberjack]
columns=16
table=reward
columndef=0:name,string
values=0:0:Lumberjack
columndef=1:desc,string
values=1:0:- This axe will act as a non-degradable variant of the crystal equivalent with no requirements.<br><br>- When this item is in your inventory or equipped\\, you gain the following perks:<br><br>- On failing to chop a tree\\, you will have a separate 50% chance to succeed.<br><br>- Items gathered from Woodcutting are automatically sent to your Bank.<br><br>You will be able to toggle the following effects on or off for the Axe:<br><br>- Automatically burning logs for Firemaking XP (regardless of your Firemaking level).<br><br>- Automatically Fletching logs into arrowshafts for Fletching XP (regardless of your Fletching level).<br><br>Additionally\\, you gain the following perks to <col=#>Firemaking</col>:<br><br>- Never fail to make fires with any logs at any Firemaking level.
columndef=3:display_graphic,graphic
values=3:0:6667
columndef=12:league_relic,struct
values=12:0:1119
columndef=15:once_per_event,boolean
values=15:0:1

[reward_animal_wrangler]
columns=16
table=reward
columndef=0:name,string
values=0:0:Animal Wrangler
columndef=1:desc,string
values=1:0:- This harpoon will act as a non-degradable variant of the crystal equivalent with no requirements.<br><br>- When this item is in your inventory or equipped\\, you gain the following perks:<br><br>- On failing to fish a spot\\, you will have a separate 50% chance to succeed.<br><br>- Items gathered from Fishing are automatically sent to your Bank.<br><br>- Fish caught have a 50% chance to be automatically cooked\\, granting Cooking experience regardless of level requirements.<br><br>- Attempt to catch fish 1 tick faster.<br><br>- It will also work for fish that don't require a harpoon to be caught\\, and your harpoon can be substituted as a Net\\, Big Net\\, Lobster Pot\\, or any Rod whilst Fishing.<br><br>Alongside the Echo harpoon effects you will get the following perks to <col=#>Hunter</col>:<br><br>- Hunter catching will never fail.<br><br>- Box traps catch chinchompas faster.<br><br>- Chinchompas are doubled when caught\\, also giving double XP.<br><br>- Impling jars no longer break upon opening them.<br><br>Lastly\\, you never burn food when Cooking.
columndef=3:display_graphic,graphic
values=3:0:6666
columndef=12:league_relic,struct
values=12:0:1118
columndef=15:once_per_event,boolean
values=15:0:1

[reward_golden_god]
columns=16
table=reward
columndef=0:name,string
values=0:0:Golden God
columndef=1:desc,string
values=1:0:You gain the following perks to the <col=#>High and Low Alchemy spells</col>:<br><br>- The spells have no rune cost or level requirement.<br><br>- Items give 15% more gold\\, and have a 65% chance to not be consumed.<br><br>- When cast on a stack of items\\, the spells will automatically be recast over time\\, until the stack is depleted or moved.<br><br>You gain the following perks to <col=#>Prayer</col>:<br><br> - 20\\,000 Coins can be offered at Prayer altars in exchange for Prayer XP equivalent to using a dragon bone. This respects altar XP modifiers. Normal altars have no modifiers.<br><br>- All items purchased from some select shops can be noted\\, provided the item can be noted at all.<br>   - There will be a new button on select shops which toggles this effect.
columndef=3:display_graphic,graphic
values=3:0:6683
columndef=12:league_relic,struct
values=12:0:1131

[reward_dodgy_deals]
columns=16
table=reward
columndef=0:name,string
values=0:0:Dodgy Deals
columndef=1:desc,string
values=1:0:You gain the following perks to <col=#>Thieving</col>:<br><br>- Pickpocketing an NPC will also pickpocket all NPCs of similar type in a 11x11 square\\, granting extra loot for each NPC pickpocketed.<br><br>- 100% success rate on all Thieving checks.<br><br> - Automatically re-pickpocket an NPC or stall until you can no longer do so.<br><br>- Items obtained from pickpocketing are noted.<br><br>- Maximum coin pouch count increased by 3x.<br><br>- Stalls do not deplete when you steal from them.
columndef=3:display_graphic,graphic
values=3:0:6673
columndef=12:league_relic,struct
values=12:0:1125

[reward_clue_compass]
columns=16
table=reward
columndef=0:name,string
values=0:0:Clue Compass
columndef=1:desc,string
values=1:0:- This item will allow you to <col=#>Teleport</col> to any S.T.A.S.H unit and Falo the Bard (Respecting area unlocks).<br><br>- It has the ability to teleport you to your current clue step\\, if you have one. Note - this will not work on clue steps that require you to kill a certain NPC.<br><br>- This item ignores wilderness teleport restrictions.<br><br>- This item cannot be used to teleport to an area you haven't unlocked.
columndef=3:display_graphic,graphic
values=3:0:2532
columndef=12:league_relic,struct
values=12:0:1120

[reward_fairy_flight]
columns=16
table=reward
columndef=0:name,string
values=0:0:Fairy's Flight
columndef=1:desc,string
values=1:0:- This item will allow you to <col=#>Teleport</col> to any fairy ring\\, spirit tree\\, or tool leprechaun.<br><br>- Unlocking this will autocomplete the Tree Gnome Village quest.<br><br>- This item ignores wilderness teleport restrictions.<br><br>- This item cannot be used to teleport to an area you haven't unlocked.
columndef=3:display_graphic,graphic
values=3:0:6668
columndef=12:league_relic,struct
values=12:0:1725

[reward_bankers_note]
columns=16
table=reward
columndef=0:name,string
values=0:0:Banker's Note
columndef=1:desc,string
values=1:0:- This item will allow you to note and unnote items anywhere in Gielinor.<br><br>- You can manually use items on the Banker's Note to unnote or note them all\\, much like a Bank.<br><br>- The 'Activate' option allows you to note and unnote items in one action with a specified quantity. An object must first be used on the Banker's Note in order for this to work.<br><br>- You can customise how many items the Banker's note will note and unnote using the quantity options.
columndef=3:display_graphic,graphic
values=3:0:6682
columndef=12:league_relic,struct
values=12:0:4719

[reward_production_prodigy]
columns=16
table=reward
columndef=0:name,string
values=0:0:Production Prodigy
columndef=1:desc,string
values=1:0:- When doing the following activities\\, all items are processed at once:<br><br>- Smelting ores\\, Smithing bars (does not work with the Superheat item spell) and making Cannonballs.<br><br>- Fletching logs\\, stringing Bows and cutting bolt tips.<br><br>- Making headless arrows\\, regular arrows\\, bolts\\, darts\\, and javelins (capped at 10x the regular amount per action).<br><br>- Cleaning herbs and making Potions which do not have a stackable secondary ingredient.<br><br>- Cooking food and making Jugs of Wine.<br><br>- Crafting leather\\, uncut gems\\, glassblowing\\, jewellery\\, pottery\\, Battlestaves and spinning flax or wool.<br><br>- Full XP is given for items processed using this Relic.<br><br>- There is a 25% chance that you will make an extra product\\, which will be sent to your Bank if you have space. The additional product will also grant XP.<br><br>- Additionally Crafting\\, Smithing\\, Herblore\\, Fletching and Cooking are boosted by +12.
columndef=3:display_graphic,graphic
values=3:0:6678
columndef=12:league_relic,struct
values=12:0:1116

[reward_last_recall]
columns=16
table=reward
columndef=0:name,string
values=0:0:Total Recall
columndef=1:desc,string
values=1:0:- This item can be used to store any single coordinate\\, alongside your Hitpoints\\, Prayer and Special Attack Energy\\, and teleport back to it at a later date\\, restoring those stats to what they were.<br><br>- This item ignores wilderness teleport restrictions.<br><br>- The Crystal of Echoes cannot store coordinates whilst inside an instance.<br><br>- There are various other locations this item won't store coordinates in\\, including quest areas\\, certain minigames\\, etc.
columndef=3:display_graphic,graphic
values=3:0:6680
columndef=12:league_relic,struct
values=12:0:1130

[reward_friendly_forager]
columns=16
table=reward
columndef=0:name,string
values=0:0:Friendly Forager
columndef=1:desc,string
values=1:0:While the <col=#>Forager's pouch</col> is worn or in your inventory\\, you gain the following benefits:<br><br>- When you gather resources from <col=#>Woodcutting</col>\\, <col=#>Fishing</col>\\, <col=#>Mining</col> and <col=#>Hunter</col>\\, the pouch will find and store a random grimy herb.<br><br>- This herb is limited to any which your <col=#>Herblore</col> level + 25 can clean. This action also provides a small amount of <col=#>Herblore</col> XP.<br><br>- The pouch will only find herbs it has room to store\\, but will always attempt to give you a herb you can receive.<br><br>- The pouch also functions as a <col=#>Silklined herb sack</col>\\, and shares an inventory with it.<br><br>Additionally\\, you gain the following perks to <col=#>Herblore</col>:<br>- All items are processed at once.</col><br>- Secondary ingredients have a 90% chance to not be consumed\\, this stacks additively with other sources.<br>- Potions created will have 4 doses instead of 3.
columndef=3:display_graphic,graphic
values=3:0:6672
columndef=12:league_relic,struct
values=12:0:1124

[reward_corner_cutter]
columns=16
table=reward
columndef=0:name,string
values=0:0:Corner Cutter
columndef=1:desc,string
values=1:0:- While equipped\\, Sage's Greaves will grant Agility XP based on your Agility level while you run.<br><br>- Completing an Agility course grants two completion count and 25% bonus XP.<br><br>- 100% success rate on all Agility checks.<br><br>- Marks of Grace will also spawn with 10\\,000 coins.<br><br>- Double Quantity of Pyramid Tops\\, Hallowed Marks and Agility Vouchers\\, and Crystal shards (from agility).
columndef=3:display_graphic,graphic
values=3:0:6671
columndef=12:league_relic,struct
values=12:0:1123

[reward_unnatural_selection]
columns=16
table=reward
columndef=0:name,string
values=0:0:Unnatural Selection
columndef=1:desc,string
values=1:0:Choose your own slayer assignments.
columndef=3:display_graphic,graphic
values=3:0:2532
columndef=12:league_relic,struct
values=12:0:729

[reward_last_stand]
columns=16
table=reward
columndef=0:name,string
values=0:0:Last Stand
columndef=1:desc,string
values=1:0:You gain the <col=#>Last Stand</col> perk\\, which works as follows:<br><br>- If damage would reduce you to 0 hp\\, you are reduced to 1 hp instead.<br><br>- Your combat stats are instantly boosted to 255 but begin draining rapidly back down to their base level + 15.<br><br>- For the next 16 ticks after this ability is activated\\, you cannot be reduced to 0 HP.<br><br>- When the effect ends\\, all incoming damage is nullified and the player is healed based on the damage they dealt over the last 16 ticks.<br><br>Once this ability is used\\, it cannot be used again until you die or 3 minutes have passed.
columndef=3:display_graphic,graphic
values=3:0:6688
columndef=12:league_relic,struct
values=12:0:1135

[reward_slayer_master]
columns=16
table=reward
columndef=0:name,string
values=0:0:Slayer Master
columndef=1:desc,string
values=1:0:Always be on-task for all slayer monsters and unlock all slayer task perks for free.
columndef=3:display_graphic,graphic
values=3:0:6679
columndef=12:league_relic,struct
values=12:0:1129

[reward_grimoire]
columns=16
table=reward
columndef=0:name,string
values=0:0:Grimoire
columndef=1:desc,string
values=1:0:- The <col=#>Grimoire</col> can be used to freely swap between spellbooks.<br><br>- The <col=#>Grimoire</col> acts as a <col=#>Book of the dead</col>.<br><br>Additionally\\, when you select this\\, you will unlock access to all prayers and spells. Regardless of area\\, quest\\, or diary requirements.
columndef=3:display_graphic,graphic
values=3:0:6684
columndef=12:league_relic,struct
values=12:0:1132

[reward_specialist]
columns=16
table=reward
columndef=0:name,string
values=0:0:Specialist
columndef=1:desc,string
values=1:0:You gain the following perks to <col=#>special attacks</col>:<br><br>- All special attacks cost 20% and have +100% accuracy.<br><br>- For each failed accuracy roll with a special attack\\, gain 10% Special Attack Energy.<br><br>- Whenever you kill an NPC\\, restore 15% Special Attack Energy.
columndef=3:display_graphic,graphic
values=3:0:6686
columndef=12:league_relic,struct
values=12:0:1134

[reward_bank_heist]
columns=16
table=reward
columndef=0:name,string
values=0:0:Bank Heist
columndef=1:desc,string
values=1:0:Gain the Banker's Briefcase\\, which can teleport to any deposit box\\, bank\\, or bank chest.
columndef=3:display_graphic,graphic
values=3:0:6669
columndef=12:league_relic,struct
values=12:0:1121

[reward_guardian]
columns=16
table=reward
columndef=0:name,string
values=0:0:Guardian
columndef=1:desc,string
values=1:0:- This item will allow you to summon a powerful <col=#>Guardian Thrall</col>\\, lasting 30 minutes.<br><br>- The guardian will attack your target with whatever style it is weak to.<br><br>- When you are in multi-combat it will cast an AoE attack if the target is weak to range or magic.<br><br>- The Guardian's stats are:<br>   - Min hit: 5<br>   - Max hit: 13<br>   - Attack Speed: 4<br>   - Accuracy: 45000<br><br>- The Guardian does not work in PvP.<br><br>- This perk will also work inside The Gauntlet.
columndef=3:display_graphic,graphic
values=3:0:6689
columndef=12:league_relic,struct
values=12:0:4728

[reward_bottomless_brew]
columns=16
table=reward
columndef=0:name,string
values=0:0:Bottomless Brew
columndef=1:desc,string
values=1:0:You gain the <col=#>Bottomless Brew</col> perk.<br>Potions will no longer be consumed when you drink them.
columndef=3:display_graphic,graphic
values=3:0:6676
columndef=12:league_relic,struct
values=12:0:6263

[reward_spells_do_not_consume_runes]
columns=16
table=reward
columndef=0:name,string
values=0:0:Rune Saviour
columndef=1:desc,string
values=1:0:Magic spells no longer require or consume Runes. This includes charges when using powered staves or tomes.
columndef=3:display_graphic,graphic
values=3:0:6670
columndef=12:league_relic,struct
values=12:0:6260

[reward_minimum_potential]
columns=16
table=reward
columndef=0:name,string
values=0:0:Minimum Potential
columndef=1:desc,string
values=1:0:You gain the <col=#>Minimum Potential</col> perk. Your Melee\\, Ranged & Magic hits will never deal below 5 damage.
columndef=3:display_graphic,graphic
values=3:0:6685
columndef=12:league_relic,struct
values=12:0:6261

[reward_spiky_aura]
columns=16
table=reward
columndef=0:name,string
values=0:0:Spiky Aura
columndef=1:desc,string
values=1:0:You reflect at least 25% of damage received. This effect stacks with other recoil effects.
columndef=3:display_graphic,graphic
values=3:0:6687
columndef=12:league_relic,struct
values=12:0:6262

[reward_gatherer]
columns=16
table=reward
columndef=0:name,string
values=0:0:Gatherer
columndef=1:desc,string
values=1:0:You gain the Gatherer benefit. You select three Gathering or Support skills\\, then whenever you gain XP in one of your 3 selected Gathering or Support skills\\, you'll gain 50% of that XP in the other 2 selected skills.<br><br>Available skills are: Mining\\, Fishing\\, Woodcutting\\, Hunter\\, Agility\\, Slayer and Thieving.
columndef=8:object,namedobj,int
values=8:0:31216,1
columndef=14:reclaimable,boolean
values=14:0:1

[reward_craftsman]
columns=16
table=reward
columndef=0:name,string
values=0:0:Craftsman
columndef=1:desc,string
values=1:0:You gain the Craftsman benefit. You select three Artisan skills\\, then whenever you gain XP in one of your 3 selected Craftsman skills\\, you'll gain 50% of that XP in the other 2 selected skills.<br><br>Available skills are: Construction\\, Cooking\\, Crafting\\, Firemaking\\, Fletching\\, Herblore\\, Runecraft and Smithing.
columndef=8:object,namedobj,int
values=8:0:31214,1
columndef=14:reclaimable,boolean
values=14:0:1

[reward_combatant]
columns=16
table=reward
columndef=0:name,string
values=0:0:Combatant
columndef=1:desc,string
values=1:0:You gain the Combatant benefit. You select three Combat skills\\, then whenever you gain XP in one of your 3 selected Combat skills\\, you'll gain 50% of that XP in the other 2 selected skills.<br><br>Available skills are: Attack\\, Strength\\, Defence\\, Hitpoints\\, Ranged\\, Magic and Prayer.
columndef=8:object,namedobj,int
values=8:0:31212,1
columndef=14:reclaimable,boolean
values=14:0:1

