values=0:0:Farmer's Fortune
columndef=1:desc,string
values=1:0:- You will harvest patches at a rate of up to 20x per action\\, noting any contents you receive.<br><br>- All patches will give 3x the yield.<br><br>- Farming patches grow instantly.<br><br>- Your plants will never die.<br><br>- You have a 20%~ chance to not use a seed or sapling when planting items in patches.
