[poll_category_lockin]
columns=5
table=poll_filters
columndef=0:category,boolean
values=0:0:1
columndef=1:id,int
values=1:0:0
columndef=2:opbase,string
values=2:0:Lock-in Polls
columndef=3:icon,graphic
values=3:0:6793
columndef=4:desc,string
values=4:0:A <col=ffb83f>lock-in poll</col> is a <col=ffb83f>commitment to release</col> the proposed game update\\, if reasonably possible\\, provided it gets sufficient support in the poll.<br><br>An update that has passed its lock-in poll <col=ffb83f>may still need to be amended or cancelled</col> if problems arise during its development\\, but otherwise the update should be delivered once it is ready.

[poll_category_greenlight]
columns=5
table=poll_filters
columndef=0:category,boolean
values=0:0:1
columndef=1:id,int
values=1:0:1
columndef=2:opbase,string
values=2:0:Greenlight Polls
columndef=3:icon,graphic
values=3:0:6794
columndef=4:desc,string
values=4:0:A <col=ffb83f>greenlight poll</col> is an <col=ffb83f>offer to explore designs</col> for the proposed game update\\, provided it gets sufficient support in the poll.<br><br>After a more detailed design has been published\\, players would be invited to vote in a <col=ffb83f>lock-in poll</col>\\, stating whether or not they still want the update locked-in for release.

[poll_category_opinion]
columns=5
table=poll_filters
columndef=0:category,boolean
values=0:0:1
columndef=1:id,int
values=1:0:2
columndef=2:opbase,string
values=2:0:Opinion Surveys
columndef=3:icon,graphic
values=3:0:6795
columndef=4:desc,string
values=4:0:An <col=ffb83f>opinion survey</col> asks players about their preferences and opinions\\, whether about Old School RuneScape\\, about gaming in general\\, about themselves or any other topic.<br><br>Although topics may include potential future changes to Old School RuneScape\\, these informal opinion surveys <col=ffb83f>do not confirm</col> that such ideas will be taken further.

