values=3:0:7196
columndef=4:facility_type,int
values=4:0:2
columndef=6:facility_desc,string
values=6:0:A sturdy mast and strong sails help your boat make the most from gusts of wind and also grant increased acceleration. They also help your boat to withstand stormy seas.

