values=16:0:32690,1
columndef=23:task_board_graphic,model
values=23:0:57830
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:I have some very important spices I need collecting from the Pandemonium and delivering to Port Sarim. They are essential in some new concoctions I have planned.<br>- Hetty

