columndef=23:task_board_graphic,model
values=23:0:57813
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:Something went wrong and I received a shipment of bait which was due for Catherby. I need a sailor who can navigate safely past Crandor to take it there for me.<br>- Gerrant

[port_task_port_sarim_courier_5]
