values=23:0:57830
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:I sent some rusty swords to be cleaned up by Tindel in Port Khazard a couple of weeks ago and I need someone to go and fetch them for me. Please don't try to steal them.<br>- Sir Vyvin

