values=23:0:57811
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:Everyone is always going on about rum from Karamja\\, but I think it's time they try some vodka from the mainland over there. Need someone to take some to Brimhaven.<br>- Rusty Anchor Bartender

