columndef=23:task_board_graphic,model
values=23:0:57811
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:Sending some lovely jewellery over to a friend in Brimhaven as a little gift. Need someone to take it over there.<br>- Anonymous

[port_task_the_pandemonium_courier_5]
