columndef=23:task_board_graphic,model
values=23:0:57823
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:Sally over at Musa Point has only gone and run out of ship parts! Classic! I've agreed to send her some of my excess bits. I just need a top sailor to take them over there for me.<br>- Junior Jim

[port_task_the_pandemonium_courier_8]
