values=16:0:32764,1
columndef=23:task_board_graphic,model
values=23:0:57825
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:I need some steel arrowtips collecting from Catherby and delivering to the Pandemonium. They'll be very useful for an upcoming party I'm planning with the Customs and Excise Office.<br>- One Eyed Rosalee

[port_task_the_pandemonium_courier_11]
