values=23:0:57815
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:I'm sending some scimitars down to some friends in Corsair Cove. However\\, I've got other business to attend to so need someone else to handle the delivery.<br>- Captain Harry Robin

[port_task_the_pandemonium_courier_12]
columns=25
