values=16:0:32623,1
columndef=23:task_board_graphic,model
values=23:0:57827
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:Some sailors in Port Khazard have been making voyages without protection against the Curse of Hawkeyed Mildred! Get these kyatt teeth over there! The magic within them will keep those sailors safe.<br>- Ribs

[port_task_the_pandemonium_courier_14]
columns=25
table=port_task
columndef=0:task_id,int
values=0:0:34
columndef=1:name,string
values=1:0:Pandemonium swamp paste delivery
columndef=2:task_type,int
values=2:0:0
columndef=3:level_required,int
values=3:0:30
columndef=4:starting_port,dbrow
values=4:0:8588
columndef=5:cargo_port,dbrow
values=5:0:8597
columndef=6:ending_port,dbrow
values=6:0:8588
columndef=16:cargo,namedobj,int
values=16:0:32778,1
columndef=23:task_board_graphic,model
values=23:0:57825
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:I need some swamp paste collecting from Port Khazard to fix some ship damage caused by nuisance pirates. I hope they're happy with the inconvenience they've caused.<br>- Captain Dawson

[port_task_the_pandemonium_courier_15]
columns=25
table=port_task
columndef=0:task_id,int
values=0:0:35
columndef=1:name,string
values=1:0:Ruin of Unkah cocktail delivery
columndef=2:task_type,int
values=2:0:0
columndef=3:level_required,int
values=3:0:48
columndef=4:starting_port,dbrow
values=4:0:8588
columndef=5:cargo_port,dbrow
values=5:0:8588
columndef=6:ending_port,dbrow
values=6:0:8606
columndef=16:cargo,namedobj,int
values=16:0:32750,2
columndef=23:task_board_graphic,model
values=23:0:57835
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:I've got a few cocktails of my own creation that I'd like sending to the hard workers at the Ruins of Unkah. I owe them for a small issue they helped with a while back while I was on pirate business. Jolly Roger!<br>- Steve Beanie

[port_task_the_pandemonium_courier_16]
columns=25
table=port_task
columndef=0:task_id,int
values=0:0:36
columndef=1:name,string
values=1:0:Pandemonium granite delivery
columndef=2:task_type,int
values=2:0:0
columndef=3:level_required,int
values=3:0:48
columndef=4:starting_port,dbrow
values=4:0:8588
columndef=5:cargo_port,dbrow
values=5:0:8606
columndef=6:ending_port,dbrow
values=6:0:8588
columndef=16:cargo,namedobj,int
values=16:0:32770,3
columndef=23:task_board_graphic,model
values=23:0:57825
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:Got a delivery of granite that was meant to arrive here\\, but it seems it was accidentally left behind. I need someone to go and collect it from the Ruins of Unkah.<br>- The Pandemonium Port Master

[port_task_the_pandemonium_courier_17]
columns=25
table=port_task
columndef=0:task_id,int
values=0:0:37
columndef=1:name,string
values=1:0:Cairn Isle secret delivery
columndef=2:task_type,int
values=2:0:0
columndef=3:level_required,int
values=3:0:42
columndef=4:starting_port,dbrow
values=4:0:8588
columndef=5:cargo_port,dbrow
values=5:0:8588
columndef=6:ending_port,dbrow
values=6:0:8602
columndef=16:cargo,namedobj,int
values=16:0:32481,3
columndef=23:task_board_graphic,model
values=23:0:57812
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:I need a top Jolly Roger to help me conduct some super secret pirate business. Just take the secret stuff to Cairn Isle\\, no questions asked.<br>- Steve Beanie

[port_task_the_pandemonium_courier_18]
columns=25
table=port_task
columndef=0:task_id,int
values=0:0:38
columndef=1:name,string
values=1:0:Ardougne sand delivery
columndef=2:task_type,int
values=2:0:0
columndef=3:level_required,int
values=3:0:28
columndef=4:starting_port,dbrow
