values=16:0:32461,1
columndef=23:task_board_graphic,model
values=23:0:57810
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:Trader Stan's lot still aren't delivering to Ardougne so it seems there's a business opportunity here. I've found a partner willing to buy as much sand as I can send. I just need someone to make the voyage.<br>- John Johnson

[port_task_musa_point_courier_0]
