values=16:0:32614,2
columndef=23:task_board_graphic,model
values=23:0:57827
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:Both the Khazard Army and the gnomes of Tree Gnome Village have put an order in for some bows. I'm not interested in picking sides\\, but as long as I supply both of them\\, there shouldn't be any problems.<br>- Hickton

[port_task_catherby_courier_5]
