columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:Someone in Civitas illa Fortis wants to get his hands on some Brimhaven pineapples. Problem is\\, they arrived here instead. I need someone to take them there while I show the previous courier a map.<br>- Port Khazard Port Master

