values=16:0:32751,3
columndef=23:task_board_graphic,model
values=23:0:57835
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:I hear that coral can be used to make potions much like herbs can. I'd like to see if it can also be used to make dyes. I just need someone to go and collect the coral I've ordered.<br>- Rana the Dyer

[port_task_ruins_of_unkah_courier_4]
