[port_task_the_summer_shore_courier_0]
columns=25
table=port_task
columndef=0:task_id,int
values=0:0:191
columndef=1:name,string
values=1:0:Ruin of Unkah calquat delivery
columndef=2:task_type,int
values=2:0:0
columndef=3:level_required,int
values=3:0:48
columndef=4:starting_port,dbrow
values=4:0:8604
columndef=5:cargo_port,dbrow
values=5:0:8604
columndef=6:ending_port,dbrow
values=6:0:8606
columndef=16:cargo,namedobj,int
values=16:0:32749,2
columndef=23:task_board_graphic,model
values=23:0:57835
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:Some fishers over at Unkah would like some calquats sending over. I'm not sure what for\\, but Elder Reggle says it's okay to trade with them. Could someone take them there for me?<br>- Guppa

[port_task_the_summer_shore_courier_1]
columns=25
table=port_task
columndef=0:task_id,int
values=0:0:192
columndef=1:name,string
values=1:0:Summer Shore rope delivery
columndef=2:task_type,int
values=2:0:0
columndef=3:level_required,int
values=3:0:48
columndef=4:starting_port,dbrow
values=4:0:8604
columndef=5:cargo_port,dbrow
values=5:0:8606
columndef=6:ending_port,dbrow
values=6:0:8604
columndef=16:cargo,namedobj,int
values=16:0:32791,2
columndef=23:task_board_graphic,model
values=23:0:57836
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:The young humans dealing with the Tempoross always make very good rope. Could someone go and fetch me some?<br>- Elder Torgan

[port_task_the_summer_shore_courier_2]
columns=25
table=port_task
columndef=0:task_id,int
values=0:0:193
columndef=1:name,string
values=1:0:Void Knights' Outpost coral delivery
columndef=2:task_type,int
values=2:0:0
columndef=3:level_required,int
values=3:0:50
columndef=4:starting_port,dbrow
values=4:0:8604
columndef=5:cargo_port,dbrow
values=5:0:8604
columndef=6:ending_port,dbrow
values=6:0:8607
columndef=16:cargo,namedobj,int
values=16:0:32794,4
columndef=23:task_board_graphic,model
values=23:0:57838
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:Some knights have asked for some coral so they can have a go at making some new potions with it. I need someone to deliver it to them.<br>- Elder Reggle

[port_task_the_summer_shore_courier_3]
columns=25
table=port_task
columndef=0:task_id,int
values=0:0:194
columndef=1:name,string
values=1:0:Summer Shore javelin delivery
columndef=2:task_type,int
values=2:0:0
columndef=3:level_required,int
values=3:0:50
columndef=4:starting_port,dbrow
values=4:0:8604
columndef=5:cargo_port,dbrow
values=5:0:8607
columndef=6:ending_port,dbrow
values=6:0:8604
columndef=16:cargo,namedobj,int
values=16:0:32998,3
columndef=23:task_board_graphic,model
values=23:0:57836
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:I hear there are human knights out there who make very good javelins. I'd be quite keen to see what we can learn from them. Would someone be able to go and collect some?<br>- Elder Torgan

[port_task_the_summer_shore_courier_4]
columns=25
table=port_task
columndef=0:task_id,int
values=0:0:195
columndef=1:name,string
values=1:0:Pandemonium coral delivery
columndef=2:task_type,int
values=2:0:0
columndef=3:level_required,int
values=3:0:45
columndef=4:starting_port,dbrow
values=4:0:8604
columndef=5:cargo_port,dbrow
values=5:0:8604
columndef=6:ending_port,dbrow
values=6:0:8588
columndef=16:cargo,namedobj,int
values=16:0:32768,2
columndef=23:task_board_graphic,model
values=23:0:57825
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:One of the adult tortugans has joined up with some sailors on the Pandemonium. She's asked me to send some coral over so she can make some potions for them. I need someone to take it over there.<br>- Elder Reggle

[port_task_the_summer_shore_courier_5]
columns=25
table=port_task
columndef=0:task_id,int
values=0:0:196
columndef=1:name,string
values=1:0:Summer Shore gem delivery
columndef=2:task_type,int
values=2:0:0
columndef=3:level_required,int
values=3:0:45
columndef=4:starting_port,dbrow
values=4:0:8604
columndef=5:cargo_port,dbrow
values=5:0:8588
columndef=6:ending_port,dbrow
values=6:0:8604
columndef=16:cargo,namedobj,int
values=16:0:32782,2
columndef=23:task_board_graphic,model
values=23:0:57836
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:It's so hard getting hold of gems around here. Would anyone be willing to go and pick up some from the Pandemonium for me?<br>- Elder Coco

[port_task_the_summer_shore_courier_6]
columns=25
table=port_task
columndef=0:task_id,int
values=0:0:197
columndef=1:name,string
values=1:0:Ruin of Unkah fish delivery
columndef=2:task_type,int
values=2:0:0
columndef=3:level_required,int
values=3:0:54
columndef=4:starting_port,dbrow
values=4:0:8604
columndef=5:cargo_port,dbrow
values=5:0:8604
columndef=6:ending_port,dbrow
values=6:0:8606
columndef=16:cargo,namedobj,int
values=16:0:32752,4
columndef=23:task_board_graphic,model
values=23:0:57835
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:Those humans over at Unkah apparently want some of my fish. They can catch plenty of their own\\, so they must have taken a particular liking to mine. I need someone to take them over there.<br>- Elder Krill

[port_task_the_summer_shore_courier_7]
columns=25
table=port_task
columndef=0:task_id,int
values=0:0:198
columndef=1:name,string
values=1:0:Void Knights' Outpost spear delivery
columndef=2:task_type,int
values=2:0:0
columndef=3:level_required,int
values=3:0:55
columndef=4:starting_port,dbrow
values=4:0:8604
columndef=5:cargo_port,dbrow
values=5:0:8604
columndef=6:ending_port,dbrow
values=6:0:8607
columndef=16:cargo,namedobj,int
values=16:0:32805,3
columndef=23:task_board_graphic,model
values=23:0:57838
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:The knights fighting those pests would like to try some of my spears. I'm looking for someone to take some to them for me.<br>- Elder Blunn

[port_task_the_summer_shore_courier_8]
columns=25
table=port_task
columndef=0:task_id,int
values=0:0:199
columndef=1:name,string
values=1:0:Pandemonium sea shell delivery
columndef=2:task_type,int
values=2:0:0
columndef=3:level_required,int
values=3:0:52
columndef=4:starting_port,dbrow
values=4:0:8604
columndef=5:cargo_port,dbrow
values=5:0:8604
columndef=6:ending_port,dbrow
values=6:0:8588
columndef=16:cargo,namedobj,int
values=16:0:32775,3
columndef=23:task_board_graphic,model
values=23:0:57825
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:Elder Krill says I'm allowed to sell any sea shells I find while fishing. I'm not allowed to leave the island yet though\\, so I need someone to take some for the Pandemonium for me. Thank you.<br>- Leff

[port_task_the_summer_shore_courier_9]
columns=25
table=port_task
columndef=0:task_id,int
values=0:0:200
columndef=1:name,string
values=1:0:Port Sarim camphor delivery
columndef=2:task_type,int
values=2:0:0
columndef=3:level_required,int
values=3:0:45
columndef=4:starting_port,dbrow
values=4:0:8604
columndef=5:cargo_port,dbrow
values=5:0:8604
columndef=6:ending_port,dbrow
values=6:0:8587
columndef=16:cargo,namedobj,int
values=16:0:32677,3
columndef=23:task_board_graphic,model
values=23:0:57830
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:I have some camphor logs that I need taking to a buyer in Port Sarim. If someone could make the delivery for me\\, that would be appreciated.<br>- Elder Katt

[port_task_the_summer_shore_courier_10]
columns=25
table=port_task
columndef=0:task_id,int
values=0:0:201
columndef=1:name,string
values=1:0:Summer Shore shield delivery
columndef=2:task_type,int
values=2:0:0
columndef=3:level_required,int
values=3:0:45
columndef=4:starting_port,dbrow
values=4:0:8604
columndef=5:cargo_port,dbrow
values=5:0:8587
columndef=6:ending_port,dbrow
values=6:0:8604
columndef=16:cargo,namedobj,int
values=16:0:32793,2
columndef=23:task_board_graphic,model
values=23:0:57836
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:I've purchased some shields from the human settlement of Falador. I'm going to study them and see if they can help us better defend ourselves from gryphons. Could someone pick them up from Port Sarim please?<br>- Elder Blunn

[port_task_the_summer_shore_courier_11]
columns=25
table=port_task
columndef=0:task_id,int
values=0:0:202
columndef=1:name,string
values=1:0:Aldarin crab paste delivery
columndef=2:task_type,int
values=2:0:0
columndef=3:level_required,int
values=3:0:46
columndef=4:starting_port,dbrow
values=4:0:8604
columndef=5:cargo_port,dbrow
values=5:0:8604
columndef=6:ending_port,dbrow
values=6:0:8605
columndef=16:cargo,namedobj,int
values=16:0:32436,3
columndef=23:task_board_graphic,model
values=23:0:57809
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:I've been asked to send some crab paste to some human alchemists all the way over on Aldarin. I need someone to take them for me.<br>- Elder Strom

[port_task_the_summer_shore_courier_12]
columns=25
table=port_task
columndef=0:task_id,int
values=0:0:203
columndef=1:name,string
values=1:0:Summer Shore potion delivery
columndef=2:task_type,int
values=2:0:0
columndef=3:level_required,int
values=3:0:46
columndef=4:starting_port,dbrow
values=4:0:8604
columndef=5:cargo_port,dbrow
values=5:0:8605
columndef=6:ending_port,dbrow
values=6:0:8604
columndef=16:cargo,namedobj,int
values=16:0:32790,2
columndef=23:task_board_graphic,model
values=23:0:57836
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:I hear there are some funny human alchemists over on Aldarin making all sorts of strange potions. Could someone bring some here so I can see what all the fuss is about?<br>- Elder Raley

