columndef=6:ending_port,dbrow
values=6:0:8613
columndef=16:cargo,namedobj,int
values=16:0:32533,5
columndef=23:task_board_graphic,model
values=23:0:57816
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:The dwarves over at Deepfin Point need some camphor for some work they're doing. Could someone take it over to them please?<br>- Elder Katt

[port_task_the_summer_shore_courier_16]
columns=25
