columndef=23:task_board_graphic,model
values=23:0:57814
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:Those humans over to the far west have finally decided to let us trade with them. They've asked me to send some coral over. I need someone to make the journey for me.<br>- Elder Reggle

