columndef=5:cargo_port,dbrow
values=5:0:8613
columndef=6:ending_port,dbrow
values=6:0:8616
columndef=16:cargo,namedobj,int
values=16:0:32716,6
columndef=23:task_board_graphic,model
values=23:0:57832
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:I thought we had access to pretty much every ore here\\, but apparently the dwarves over at Deepfin Point have some rare ones that we don't. I need someone to collect some so I can see if it's true.<br>- Gwyn

[port_task_prifddinas_courier_11]
columns=25
table=port_task
columndef=0:task_id,int
values=0:0:373
columndef=1:name,string
values=1:0:Aldarin crystal seed delivery
columndef=2:task_type,int
values=2:0:0
columndef=3:level_required,int
values=3:0:70
columndef=4:starting_port,dbrow
values=4:0:8616
columndef=5:cargo_port,dbrow
values=5:0:8616
columndef=6:ending_port,dbrow
values=6:0:8605
columndef=16:cargo,namedobj,int
values=16:0:32437,7
columndef=23:task_board_graphic,model
values=23:0:57809
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:The Alchemical Society on Aldarin are very keen to get a closer look at some crystal seeds. I've agreed to send some over on the condition that they take very good care of them. Anyone able to take them?<br>- Reese

[port_task_prifddinas_courier_12]
columns=25
table=port_task
columndef=0:task_id,int
values=0:0:374
columndef=1:name,string
values=1:0:Prifddinas potion delivery
columndef=2:task_type,int
values=2:0:0
columndef=3:level_required,int
values=3:0:70
columndef=4:starting_port,dbrow
values=4:0:8616
columndef=5:cargo_port,dbrow
values=5:0:8605
columndef=6:ending_port,dbrow
values=6:0:8616
columndef=16:cargo,namedobj,int
values=16:0:32987,7
columndef=23:task_board_graphic,model
values=23:0:57832
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:There's some alchemists over on Aldarin making some fancy new potions. I'd like someone to bring some here so I can see what's so special about them.<br>- Llio

[port_task_prifddinas_courier_13]
columns=25
table=port_task
columndef=0:task_id,int
values=0:0:375
