columndef=6:ending_port,dbrow
values=6:0:8616
columndef=16:cargo,namedobj,int
values=16:0:32719,7
columndef=23:task_board_graphic,model
values=23:0:57832
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:The human kingdom of Varlamore is now open for trade and I'm keen to get my hands on some of their unique spices. Could someone go and collect some for me?<br>- Caerwyn

[port_task_prifddinas_courier_15]
columns=25
table=port_task
columndef=0:task_id,int
values=0:0:377
columndef=1:name,string
values=1:0:Lunar Isle crystal seed delivery
columndef=2:task_type,int
values=2:0:0
columndef=3:level_required,int
values=3:0:76
columndef=4:starting_port,dbrow
values=4:0:8616
columndef=5:cargo_port,dbrow
values=5:0:8616
columndef=6:ending_port,dbrow
values=6:0:8618
columndef=16:cargo,namedobj,int
values=16:0:32581,8
columndef=23:task_board_graphic,model
values=23:0:57822
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:I've agreed to send some of our crystal seeds to some odd mages north of here. They're sending some of their curious dream potions back in return. Looking for someone to take the crystal seeds to them.<br>- Reese

[port_task_prifddinas_courier_16]
columns=25
table=port_task
columndef=0:task_id,int
values=0:0:378
columndef=1:name,string
values=1:0:Rellekka plank delivery
