columndef=23:task_board_graphic,model
values=23:0:57832
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:I've managed to convince some of those mages from Arceuus to exchange some books with us. I need someone to carefully collect them from Port Piscarilius and bring them back here.<br>- Lilifang

[port_task_rellekka_courier_0]
columns=25
