columndef=23:task_board_graphic,model
values=23:0:57818
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:Etceteria need more fish again. Probably too busy fighting with Miscellania to just go and fish their own. Looking for someone to make the delivery.<br>- Rellekka Fishmonger

[port_task_rellekka_courier_1]
columns=25
