values=23:0:57834
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:I hear there are some fancy fish that they keep catching over at Piscatoris. I want to see what all the fuss is about. I bet ours are still better.<br>- Sigmund the Merchant

[port_task_rellekka_courier_13]
columns=25
