values=23:0:57820
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:Jatizso are in need of more logs again. Probably wasn't very smart of them to cut down the few trees they had. I need someone to take some to them.<br>- Sigmund the Merchant

[port_task_rellekka_courier_16]
