columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:Looking for a Jolly Roger willing to find the beak of a frigatebird for me. I reckon I can craft one into a lucky pirate charm! I hear there are plenty of the scallywags to be found out at Angerfish's Light.<br>- Steve Beanie

