values=24:0:Bit of an odd one\\, but we quite urgently need an albatross beak to help with a crime scene recreation for an ongoing trial. Local sailors say plenty of the birds can be found in the Tortugan Sea.<br>- Seers' Village Courthouse

[port_task_brimhaven_bounty_0]
