values=23:0:57780
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:My people are asking me to provide them with protective charms\\, but I can't make them without osprey feathers. I hear plenty of the birds can be found north west of Brimhaven.<br>- Trufitus

[port_task_brimhaven_bounty_1]
