values=22:0:3
columndef=23:task_board_graphic,model
values=23:0:57781
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:Seems that barely anyone wants to spend a night in my dormitory any more. It must be the pillows. I need someone to collect some feathers from the terns near Entrana so I can make things more comfortable.<br>- Kaleb Paramaya

