columndef=23:task_board_graphic,model
values=23:0:57783
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:There are some mogres in the Kharazi Strait that are targeting passing vessels. Could someone head out there and kill a few. Be sure to bring back proof if you want paying.<br>- Corsair Cove Port Master

[port_task_corsair_cove_bounty_3]
