columndef=23:task_board_graphic,model
values=23:0:57801
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:I'm in need of something new to cook and I hear ray fins have a unique flavour. Could someone collect a few from some stingray? Apparently there are some out in the Sea of Souls.<br>- Gnocci

[port_task_corsair_cove_bounty_4]
