columndef=23:task_board_graphic,model
values=23:0:57780
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:I need an osprey beak for a spear I'm working on. Looking for someone to collect one for me. According to the local 'sailors'\\, plenty of osprey can be found up in the Brimhaven Passage.<br>- Freja

[port_task_corsair_cove_bounty_5]
