values=23:0:57808
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:Apparently shark livers have some interesting medicinal properties. I need someone to collect one from a tiger shark for me. I'm told plenty can be found in the Sea of Souls.<br>- Madame Caldarium

