columndef=23:task_board_graphic,model
values=23:0:57802
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:We keep losing supplies from the north thanks to a group of bull sharks by the Pandemonium. I need someone to kill a few. Keep in mind that I'll only pay upon seeing proof.<br>- Ruins of Unkah Port Master

[port_task_ruins_of_unkah_bounty_1]
