columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:Some tiger sharks in the Menaphite Sea are causing problems for any vessels passing by. I need someone to sort them out. Make sure to bring back proof of having done so.<br>- Ruins of Unkah Port Master

[port_task_ruins_of_unkah_bounty_3]
