values=22:0:2
columndef=23:task_board_graphic,model
values=23:0:57798
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:I need butterfly ray fins. Some love the taste of them\\, but I say their flesh stinks and chews like old boots. Still\\, they make for the best bait you'll ever sling. You can find some out in the Turtle Belt.<br>- Ishmael

[port_task_ruins_of_unkah_bounty_4]
