values=23:0:57799
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:Gita Prymes seeks the finest boot leather for slick decks. Only eagle ray skin'll keep a sailor steady. Find some north of the Great Conch.<br>- Gita Prymes

[port_task_ruins_of_unkah_bounty_5]
