values=23:0:57775
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:They call the albatross lucky\\, and I reckon like a rabbit's foot\\, the luck lies in a single piece. I think for an albatross\\, it's all in the beak. I hear there are plenty out in the Tortugan Sea.<br>- Taiman

[port_task_ruins_of_unkah_bounty_6]
