values=23:0:57798
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:We've run out of blasted sandpaper again\\, but one of the sailors claims ray skin can be used as a substitute. I need someone to get me some from a butterfly ray. Should be plenty north west of the Isle of Souls.<br>- Port Piscarilius Dockmaster

