columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:Hammerhead sharks are gathering north west of Port Roberts\\, drawn by rubbish tossed from waiting boats. We need them culled.  Payment will be provided on proof of some kills.<br>- Civitas illa Fortis Port Master

