values=23:0:57781
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:Rather than gems\\, my best customer has requested a tern beak! I've no idea why\\, but best I keep him happy. I hear there are plenty of terns north of Shipwreck Cove. Just don't go getting shipwrecked yourself.<br>- Fortis Gem Merchant

