columndef=21:bounty_object_amount,int
values=21:0:5
columndef=22:bounty_object_rarity,int
values=22:0:10
columndef=23:task_board_graphic,model
values=23:0:57796
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:We've got a nasty spined kraken north west of Miscellania. I need someone to head out there and kill it. Make sure to bring back evidence to show it's dead.<br>- Etceteria Port Master

