columndef=23:task_board_graphic,model
values=23:0:57788
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:The spikes on my caulk boots keep breaking. Someone suggested I try using orca teeth instead. Looking for someone to bring me some. There should be plenty of orcas in the Stoneheart Sea.<br>- Carpenter Kjallak

