values=23:0:57797
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:Some vampyre kraken out in the Everwinter Sea keep straying down here. I need someone to head up there and kill a few so they're less likely to come out this way. Make sure to bring back proof once it's done.<br>- Lunar Isle Port Master

[port_task_lunar_isle_bounty_2]
