values=22:0:2
columndef=23:task_board_graphic,model
values=23:0:57787
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:Stores be running dry\\, so we're going DIY. Need narwhal blubber for lamp oil. You'll find plenty in the Lunar Sea. Looking for anyone sailing up there to fetch some back.<br>- Captain Bentley

