values=23:0:57788
columndef=24:flavour_text,string
values=24:0:Looking for orca blubber for a little hobby of mine: Candle-making by moonlight. If anyone is willing to help\\, there should be plenty of orcas west of the island.<br>- Melana Moonlander

[port_task_lunar_isle_bounty_4]
