[skill_feature_agility_overview_0]
columns=10
table=skill_features
columndef=0:icon,obj
values=0:0:6518
columndef=2:text,string
values=2:0:Agility both increases the rate at which your Run Energy replenishes while not running and decreases the rate at which it drains while you run.
columndef=3:skill,int,int,int
values=3:0:8,-1,0
columndef=6:membersonly,boolean
values=6:0:1

[skill_feature_agility_overview_1]
columns=10
table=skill_features
columndef=0:icon,obj
values=0:0:6520
columndef=2:text,string
values=2:0:You will also gain access to useful shortcuts across Gielinor; these are marked with a green arrow on your map.
columndef=3:skill,int,int,int
values=3:0:8,-1,0
columndef=6:membersonly,boolean
values=6:0:1

