[skill_feature_attack_overview_0]
columns=10
table=skill_features
columndef=0:icon,obj
values=0:0:1279
columndef=2:text,string
values=2:0:Your Attack level is used to determine how likely you are to hit your target in melee combat. A higher Attack level will give you a better chance to hit.
columndef=3:skill,int,int,int
values=3:0:1,-1,0
columndef=6:membersonly,boolean
values=6:0:0

[skill_feature_attack_overview_1]
columns=10
table=skill_features
columndef=0:icon,obj
values=0:0:1333
columndef=2:text,string
values=2:0:Additionally\\, a higher Attack level will allow you to wield more powerful weapons. A weapon with a higher Attack bonus will give you more accuracy in combat.
columndef=3:skill,int,int,int
values=3:0:1,-1,0
columndef=6:membersonly,boolean
values=6:0:0

[skill_feature_attack_overview_2]
columns=10
table=skill_features
columndef=0:icon,obj
values=0:0:1215
columndef=2:text,string
values=2:0:You can select your Attack style from the Combat Options side panel. Different enemies are weaker or stronger against different Attack styles\\, so choose carefully.
columndef=3:skill,int,int,int
values=3:0:1,-1,0
columndef=6:membersonly,boolean
values=6:0:0

