[skill_feature_construction_overview_0]
columns=10
table=skill_features
columndef=0:icon,obj
values=0:0:8794
columndef=2:text,string
values=2:0:Construction gives you access to your very owned Player-Owned House. To get started\\, you'll need to buy a house from an Estate agent.
columndef=3:skill,int,int,int
values=3:0:22,-1,0
columndef=6:membersonly,boolean
values=6:0:1

[skill_feature_construction_overview_1]
columns=10
table=skill_features
columndef=0:icon,obj
values=0:0:960
columndef=2:text,string
values=2:0:Once you have a house\\, you'll need to build furniture. Most furniture can be built with planks\\, which can be obtained via taking logs to a sawmill.
columndef=3:skill,int,int,int
values=3:0:22,-1,0
columndef=6:membersonly,boolean
values=6:0:1

[skill_feature_construction_overview_2]
columns=10
table=skill_features
columndef=0:icon,obj
values=0:0:2347
columndef=2:text,string
values=2:0:To build furniture\\, grab a hammer and a saw\\, enter your house in build mode\\, select a hotspot and select the furniture you want to build.
columndef=3:skill,int,int,int
values=3:0:22,-1,0
columndef=6:membersonly,boolean
values=6:0:1

[skill_feature_construction_overview_3]
columns=10
table=skill_features
columndef=0:icon,obj
values=0:0:8151
columndef=2:text,string
values=2:0:As your Construction level increases\\, you'll be able to build bigger houses\\, gain access to more kinds of room in your house\\, and be able to build fancier furniture.
columndef=3:skill,int,int,int
values=3:0:22,-1,0
columndef=6:membersonly,boolean
values=6:0:1

[skill_feature_construction_overview_4]
columns=10
table=skill_features
columndef=0:icon,obj
values=0:0:795
columndef=2:text,string
values=2:0:You'll also become able to build better facilities for boats.
columndef=3:skill,int,int,int
values=3:0:22,-1,0
columndef=6:membersonly,boolean
values=6:0:1

