[skill_feature_cooking_overview_0]
columns=10
table=skill_features
columndef=0:icon,obj
values=0:0:977
columndef=2:text,string
values=2:0:Cooking is a skill that lets you make all kinds of delicious food that will typically restore your Hitpoints\\, amongst providing other benefits.
columndef=3:skill,int,int,int
values=3:0:16,-1,0
columndef=6:membersonly,boolean
values=6:0:0

[skill_feature_cooking_overview_1]
columns=10
table=skill_features
columndef=0:icon,obj
values=0:0:315
columndef=2:text,string
values=2:0:At its most basic\\, Cooking can be done by simply taking raw meats and fish to either a fire or a range. You'll get better results overall if you use a range\\, though.
columndef=3:skill,int,int,int
values=3:0:16,-1,0
columndef=6:membersonly,boolean
values=6:0:0

[skill_feature_cooking_overview_2]
columns=10
table=skill_features
columndef=0:icon,obj
values=0:0:2309
columndef=2:text,string
values=2:0:Some foods will require you to prepare your ingredients before you can cook them. For example\\, you first need to mix flour and water into a dough before you can bake them into bread.
columndef=3:skill,int,int,int
values=3:0:16,-1,0
columndef=6:membersonly,boolean
values=6:0:0

[skill_feature_cooking_overview_3]
columns=10
table=skill_features
columndef=0:icon,obj
values=0:0:379
columndef=2:text,string
values=2:0:As your Cooking level increases\\, you'll get access to an increasing list of recipes. You'll also find that you accidentally burn your food less of the time as well.
columndef=3:skill,int,int,int
values=3:0:16,-1,0
columndef=6:membersonly,boolean
values=6:0:0

[skill_feature_cooking_cooked_meat]
columns=10
table=skill_features
columndef=0:icon,obj
