[skill_feature_crafting_overview_0]
columns=10
table=skill_features
columndef=0:icon,obj
values=0:0:2347
columndef=2:text,string
values=2:0:Crafting is a wide-ranging skill that allows you to create various pieces of armour\\, jewellery\\, equipment and more.
columndef=3:skill,int,int,int
values=3:0:11,-1,0
columndef=6:membersonly,boolean
values=6:0:0

[skill_feature_crafting_overview_1]
columns=10
table=skill_features
columndef=0:icon,obj
values=0:0:1741
columndef=2:text,string
values=2:0:To craft armour out of animal hides\\, you'll typically first need to take the hides to a tanner to get them tanned\\, then combine them with a needle and thread\\, which can be acquired from certain Crafting shops in the world.
columndef=3:skill,int,int,int
values=3:0:11,-1,0
columndef=6:membersonly,boolean
values=6:0:0

[skill_feature_crafting_overview_2]
columns=10
table=skill_features
columndef=0:icon,obj
values=0:0:1761
columndef=2:text,string
values=2:0:To make pottery\\, you'll need to obtain some soft clay\\, obtained by adding water to clay. You can then use a pottery wheel to shape the clay into an unfired item\\, which you can then finish in a pottery oven.
columndef=3:skill,int,int,int
values=3:0:11,-1,0
columndef=6:membersonly,boolean
values=6:0:0

[skill_feature_crafting_overview_3]
columns=10
table=skill_features
columndef=0:icon,obj
values=0:0:2357
columndef=2:text,string
values=2:0:To make jewellery\\, you'll need to first get a crafting mould. You can then take that mould and some gold or silver bars to a furnace to craft your jewellery. At higher Crafting levels\\, you can cut gems and mould them simultaneously to create jewellery\\, which you can enchant with Magic!
columndef=3:skill,int,int,int
values=3:0:11,-1,0
columndef=6:membersonly,boolean
values=6:0:0

