[skill_feature_defence_overview_0]
columns=10
table=skill_features
columndef=0:icon,obj
values=0:0:1191
columndef=2:text,string
values=2:0:Your Defence level determines how likely you are to block enemy attacks. The chances of this happening increase with your level\\, but be careful; you are never guaranteed to block every attack!
columndef=3:skill,int,int,int
values=3:0:5,-1,0
columndef=6:membersonly,boolean
values=6:0:0

[skill_feature_defence_overview_1]
columns=10
table=skill_features
columndef=0:icon,obj
values=0:0:1147
columndef=2:text,string
values=2:0:Additionally\\, a higher Defence level will allow you to equip more powerful shields and armour. As well as giving you better defensive stats\\, some armour will also increase your Attack or Strength bonuses as well.
columndef=3:skill,int,int,int
values=3:0:5,-1,0
columndef=6:membersonly,boolean
values=6:0:0

