[skill_feature_farming_overview_0]
columns=10
table=skill_features
columndef=0:icon,obj
values=0:0:6797
columndef=2:text,string
values=2:0:Farming allows you to grow various flowers\\, vegetables\\, trees\\, herbs and more in farming patches across Gielinor.
columndef=3:skill,int,int,int
values=3:0:21,-1,0
columndef=6:membersonly,boolean
values=6:0:1

[skill_feature_farming_overview_1]
columns=10
table=skill_features
columndef=0:icon,obj
values=0:0:5166
columndef=2:text,string
values=2:0:To get started\\, you'll need some seeds and a seed dibber\\, as well as a rake to remove weeds from the patch you want to use.
columndef=3:skill,int,int,int
values=3:0:21,-1,0
columndef=6:membersonly,boolean
values=6:0:1

[skill_feature_farming_overview_2]
columns=10
table=skill_features
columndef=0:icon,obj
values=0:0:5341
columndef=2:text,string
values=2:0:Once you've cleared the patch\\, you can add your seed to it. You can also optionally water it with a watering can or add a bucket of compost to decrease the chances of your plant becoming diseased.
columndef=3:skill,int,int,int
values=3:0:21,-1,0
columndef=6:membersonly,boolean
values=6:0:1

[skill_feature_farming_overview_3]
columns=10
table=skill_features
columndef=0:icon,obj
values=0:0:5343
columndef=2:text,string
values=2:0:It'll take a while for your plant to grow\\, so feel free to explore the world and come back to it later!
columndef=3:skill,int,int,int
values=3:0:21,-1,0
columndef=6:membersonly,boolean
values=6:0:1

[skill_feature_farming_overview_4]
columns=10
table=skill_features
columndef=0:icon,obj
values=0:0:1942
columndef=2:text,string
values=2:0:Once your plant has grown\\, you might need another tool to collect the harvest. For instance\\, you'll need a spade to dig up potatoes.
columndef=3:skill,int,int,int
values=3:0:21,-1,0
columndef=6:membersonly,boolean
values=6:0:1

[skill_feature_farming_overview_5]
columns=10
table=skill_features
columndef=0:icon,obj
values=0:0:6036
columndef=2:text,string
values=2:0:If you're worried about your crops becoming diseased\\, most crops can be protected by the nearby gardeners. They'll usually want you to give them specific produce in payment.
columndef=3:skill,int,int,int
values=3:0:21,-1,0
columndef=6:membersonly,boolean
values=6:0:1

[skill_feature_farming_overview_6]
columns=10
table=skill_features
columndef=0:icon,obj
values=0:0:6032
columndef=2:text,string
values=2:0:As your Farming level increases\\, you'll gain access to more crops to grow\\, as well as obtaining greater yields when harvesting.
columndef=3:skill,int,int,int
values=3:0:21,-1,0
columndef=6:membersonly,boolean
values=6:0:1

