[skill_feature_fishing_overview_0]
columns=10
table=skill_features
columndef=0:icon,obj
values=0:0:341
columndef=2:text,string
values=2:0:Fishing allows you to gather fish at various points across Gielinor. Typically\\, these will be indicated by moving bubbles on the surface of the water.
columndef=3:skill,int,int,int
values=3:0:15,-1,0
columndef=6:membersonly,boolean
values=6:0:0

[skill_feature_fishing_overview_1]
columns=10
table=skill_features
columndef=0:icon,obj
values=0:0:303
columndef=2:text,string
values=2:0:Different fish require different equipment to catch; for instance\\, you need a fishing net to catch shrimp\\, but a fishing rod and bait to catch sardines.
columndef=3:skill,int,int,int
values=3:0:15,-1,0
columndef=6:membersonly,boolean
values=6:0:0

[skill_feature_fishing_overview_2]
columns=10
table=skill_features
columndef=0:icon,obj
values=0:0:377
columndef=2:text,string
values=2:0:As your Fishing level increases\\, you'll gain access to more varieties of fish to catch\\, as well as having a higher chance of successfully catching fish when you try.
columndef=3:skill,int,int,int
values=3:0:15,-1,0
columndef=6:membersonly,boolean
values=6:0:0

