[skill_feature_fletching_overview_0]
columns=10
table=skill_features
columndef=0:icon,obj
values=0:0:314
columndef=2:text,string
values=2:0:Fletching allows you to create various ranged weapons\\, as well as ammunition to go with them.
columndef=3:skill,int,int,int
values=3:0:19,-1,0
columndef=6:membersonly,boolean
values=6:0:1

[skill_feature_fletching_overview_1]
columns=10
table=skill_features
columndef=0:icon,obj
values=0:0:1777
columndef=2:text,string
values=2:0:Making bows requires bowstring\\, which can be made from flax at a spinning wheel. You can use a knife on some logs to carve an unfinished bow\\, then add the bowstring to complete the weapon.
columndef=3:skill,int,int,int
values=3:0:19,-1,0
columndef=6:membersonly,boolean
values=6:0:1

[skill_feature_fletching_overview_2]
columns=10
table=skill_features
columndef=0:icon,obj
values=0:0:6447
columndef=2:text,string
values=2:0:To create arrows\\, you'll first need to carve logs into arrow shafts with a knife\\, then tip the arrow shafts with feathers. Finally\\, you'll need to add some arrow heads.
columndef=3:skill,int,int,int
values=3:0:19,-1,0
columndef=6:membersonly,boolean
values=6:0:1

[skill_feature_fletching_overview_3]
columns=10
table=skill_features
columndef=0:icon,obj
values=0:0:9400
columndef=2:text,string
values=2:0:To make bolts\\, you only need to combine unfinished bolts with feathers. You can also chisel gemstones down into bolt tips\\, with each gemstone being able to top a different bolt.
columndef=3:skill,int,int,int
values=3:0:19,-1,0
columndef=6:membersonly,boolean
values=6:0:1

