columndef=0:icon,obj
values=0:0:199
columndef=2:text,string
values=2:0:To make a potion\\, you first need to clean a grimy herb\\, then combine it with a vial of water to make an unfinished potion. You can then add the secondary ingredient(s) to complete the potion.
