[skill_feature_prayer_overview_0]
columns=10
table=skill_features
columndef=0:icon,obj
values=0:0:3258
columndef=2:text,string
values=2:0:Prayer allows you to access different prayers\\, available from the Prayer side panel. Each prayer offers a different powerful benefit.
columndef=3:skill,int,int,int
values=3:0:7,-1,0
columndef=6:membersonly,boolean
values=6:0:0

[skill_feature_prayer_overview_1]
columns=10
table=skill_features
columndef=0:icon,obj
values=0:0:20803
columndef=1:sprite,graphic,int,int,int,int
values=1:0:115,30,30,0,0
columndef=2:text,string
values=2:0:Using prayers will drain your prayer points over time. Once you run out of prayer points\\, you will be unable to use any prayers. You can restore your prayer points by praying at an altar.
columndef=3:skill,int,int,int
values=3:0:7,-1,0
columndef=6:membersonly,boolean
values=6:0:0

[skill_feature_prayer_overview_2]
columns=10
table=skill_features
columndef=0:icon,obj
values=0:0:544
columndef=2:text,string
values=2:0:Some pieces of equipment will grant you a Prayer bonus\\, which will reduce the rate at which your prayer points are drained.
columndef=3:skill,int,int,int
values=3:0:7,-1,0
columndef=6:membersonly,boolean
values=6:0:0

[skill_feature_prayer_overview_3]
columns=10
table=skill_features
columndef=0:icon,obj
values=0:0:526
columndef=2:text,string
values=2:0:The most common way to increase your Prayer level is to offer the remains of the enemies you kill. Burying their bones and scattering their ashes will award you Prayer experience.
columndef=3:skill,int,int,int
values=3:0:7,-1,0
columndef=6:membersonly,boolean
values=6:0:0

