[skill_feature_ranged_overview_0]
columns=10
table=skill_features
columndef=0:icon,obj
values=0:0:841
columndef=2:text,string
values=2:0:Your Ranged level determines how accurate you are with ranged weapons\\, as well as how much damage they do. A higher Ranged level will result in more hits that do more damage.
columndef=3:skill,int,int,int
values=3:0:3,-1,0
columndef=6:membersonly,boolean
values=6:0:0

[skill_feature_ranged_overview_1]
columns=10
table=skill_features
columndef=0:icon,obj
values=0:0:888
columndef=2:text,string
values=2:0:Most ranged weapons will need a specific kind of ammunition to go with them; for instance\\, bows will need arrows and crossbows will need bolts.
columndef=3:skill,int,int,int
values=3:0:3,-1,0
columndef=6:membersonly,boolean
values=6:0:0

[skill_feature_ranged_overview_2]
columns=10
table=skill_features
columndef=0:icon,obj
values=0:0:9185
columndef=2:text,string
values=2:0:As your Ranged level increases\\, you will also get access to more powerful weapons and ammunition. Typically\\, each ranged weapon can only handle ammo up to a certain level; for instance\\, an oak bow can only fire bronze\\, iron or steel arrows\\, but not mithril.
columndef=3:skill,int,int,int
values=3:0:3,-1,0
columndef=6:membersonly,boolean
values=6:0:0

