[skill_feature_runecraft_overview_0]
columns=10
table=skill_features
columndef=0:icon,obj
values=0:0:1436
columndef=2:text,string
values=2:0:Runecraft is the skill that allows you to convert essences into runes\\, which you can use to cast spells.
columndef=3:skill,int,int,int
values=3:0:12,-1,0
columndef=6:membersonly,boolean
values=6:0:0

[skill_feature_runecraft_overview_1]
columns=10
table=skill_features
columndef=0:icon,obj
values=0:0:1438
columndef=2:text,string
values=2:0:To create runes\\, you'll first need some essence and a talisman of the rune you want to make. You can use the talisman to both locate and access the runic altar\\, which is where the runes are crafted.
columndef=3:skill,int,int,int
values=3:0:12,-1,0
columndef=6:membersonly,boolean
values=6:0:0

[skill_feature_runecraft_overview_2]
columns=10
table=skill_features
columndef=0:icon,obj
values=0:0:554
columndef=2:text,string
values=2:0:Higher Runecraft levels will allow you to craft more kinds of runes. At higher levels\\, you'll also be able to make multiple runes per essence.
columndef=3:skill,int,int,int
values=3:0:12,-1,0
columndef=6:membersonly,boolean
values=6:0:0

