values=2:0:You must complete the Pandemonium quest to unlock the Sailing skill.
columndef=3:skill,int,int,int
values=3:0:24,-1,0
columndef=6:membersonly,boolean
values=6:0:1

[skill_feature_sailing_overview_1]
columns=10
table=skill_features
columndef=0:icon,obj
values=0:0:32241
columndef=2:text,string
values=2:0:Sailing gives you the ability to captain a boat and sail the seas of Gielinor. Out at sea\\, you'll find all kinds of things to do. You can salvage shipwrecks for sunken treasure\\, test yourself in Barracuda Trials\\, or explore uncharted islands\\, to name but a few possibilities.
columndef=3:skill,int,int,int
values=3:0:24,-1,0
columndef=6:membersonly,boolean
values=6:0:1

[skill_feature_sailing_overview_2]
columns=10
table=skill_features
columndef=0:icon,obj
values=0:0:32256
columndef=2:text,string
values=2:0:As your Sailing level increases\\, you'll be able to own more boats\\, build better facilities on your boats\\, hire more crewmates\\, dock at more locations\\, and much more!
columndef=3:skill,int,int,int
values=3:0:24,-1,0
columndef=6:membersonly,boolean
values=6:0:1

