[skill_feature_slayer_overview_0]
columns=10
table=skill_features
columndef=0:icon,obj
values=0:0:964
columndef=2:text,string
values=2:0:Slayer is a skill that lets you fight increasingly dangerous and lucrative monsters. Some monsters can only be fought if you have a high enough Slayer level.
columndef=3:skill,int,int,int
values=3:0:20,-1,0
columndef=6:membersonly,boolean
values=6:0:1

[skill_feature_slayer_overview_1]
columns=10
table=skill_features
columndef=0:icon,obj
values=0:0:4155
columndef=2:text,string
values=2:0:To get started with Slayer\\, you'll first need a Slayer task\\, which can be obtained by speaking to a Slayer Master. You can then kill the assigned target to get Slayer experience.
columndef=3:skill,int,int,int
values=3:0:20,-1,0
columndef=6:membersonly,boolean
values=6:0:1

[skill_feature_slayer_overview_2]
columns=10
table=skill_features
columndef=0:icon,obj
values=0:0:11864
columndef=2:text,string
values=2:0:Once you've completed five tasks\\, you can start earning reward points. These can be used to skip or block tasks you don't want\\, or to purchase useful equipment\\, or to unlock benefits such as extended tasks.
columndef=3:skill,int,int,int
values=3:0:20,-1,0
columndef=6:membersonly,boolean
values=6:0:1

