values=3:0:14,-1,0
columndef=6:membersonly,boolean
values=6:0:0

[skill_feature_smithing_overview_1]
columns=10
table=skill_features
columndef=0:icon,obj
values=0:0:440
columndef=2:text,string
values=2:0:To smelt ores\\, simply take the mix of ores you need to any furnace and you'll be able to convert them into bars.
columndef=3:skill,int,int,int
values=3:0:14,-1,0
columndef=6:membersonly,boolean
values=6:0:0

[skill_feature_smithing_overview_2]
columns=10
table=skill_features
columndef=0:icon,obj
values=0:0:2347
columndef=2:text,string
values=2:0:Once you have your bars\\, grab a hammer and take them to an anvil. Bigger items will need more bars to make.
columndef=3:skill,int,int,int
values=3:0:14,-1,0
columndef=6:membersonly,boolean
values=6:0:0

