[skill_feature_woodcutting_overview_0]
columns=10
table=skill_features
columndef=0:icon,obj
values=0:0:8175
columndef=2:text,string
values=2:0:Woodcutting allows you to chop down trees to obtain logs. Most trees in the game can be chopped down with an axe.
columndef=3:skill,int,int,int
values=3:0:18,-1,0
columndef=6:membersonly,boolean
values=6:0:0

[skill_feature_woodcutting_overview_1]
columns=10
table=skill_features
columndef=0:icon,obj
values=0:0:1511
columndef=2:text,string
values=2:0:Increasing your Woodcutting level will give you a higher chance of successfully chopping a tree. You'll also gain access to more trees to cut down.
columndef=3:skill,int,int,int
values=3:0:18,-1,0
columndef=6:membersonly,boolean
values=6:0:0

[skill_feature_woodcutting_overview_2]
columns=10
table=skill_features
columndef=0:icon,obj
values=0:0:1359
columndef=2:text,string
values=2:0:In addition to this\\, higher Woodcutting levels grant access to more powerful axes\\, which also increase the chance of chopping trees. Note that you can still use an axe in your inventory if you have the Woodcutting level for it\\, even if you don't have the Attack level to equip it.
columndef=3:skill,int,int,int
values=3:0:18,-1,0
columndef=6:membersonly,boolean
values=6:0:0

