values=1:0:6446
columndef=2:toggle_desc,string
values=2:0:Transmutation spells bank noted products.
columndef=3:toggle_on_message,string
values=3:0:Transmutation spells will now send noted products to the bank.
columndef=4:toggle_off_message,string
values=4:0:Transmutation spells will now send noted products to the inventory.
